       _c_o_n_t_e_x_t.  The argument _a_t_t_r  is  a  pointer  to  an  ibv_device_attr_ex
       struct, as defined in <infiniband/verbs.h>.

       struct ibv_values_ex {
               uint32_t             comp_mask;    /* Compatibility mask that defines the query/queried fields [in/out] */
